WEBVTT

00:11:27.684 --> 00:11:30.520
na lori la kubebea
wanalozunguka nalo shambani,

00:11:30.614 --> 00:11:33.960
iliotengenezwa na sehemu
zilizotoka duniani kote.

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:37.896
kwa kweli, Marekani wanauza chuma
kwenda Colombia.

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:42.606
Hivyo nikaenda Indiana,
na nikawashukuru watengeneza chuma.

00:11:43.314 --> 00:11:46.180
Na ikanipeleka tu nyumbani

00:11:46.494 --> 00:11:49.830
kua haichukui kijiji
kutengeneza kikombe cha kahawa.

00:11:50.004 --> 00:11:53.060
Inachukua dunia
kutengeneza kikombe cha kahawa.

00:11:53.294 --> 00:11:58.220
Na huu uchumi wa dunia,
huu utandawazi,

00:11:58.374 --> 00:11:59.850
unakua na hasara.

00:11:59.850 --> 00:12:03.816
Lakini na amini faida zake
za muda mrefu ni kubwa zaidi,